WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:14.260 --> 00:00:16.080
What's happenin', B?

00:00:16.080 --> 00:00:21.860
This week we beastin through the darkness
with A Wrinkle in Time by Madeleine L'Engle.

00:00:23.380 --> 00:00:28.119
Dis night dark n' stormy as f*ck and lil'
Meg Murry can't get no sleep.

00:00:28.119 --> 00:00:32.599
Girl got all kinda mess runnin through her
dome: lotta bullshit goin down wit haters

00:00:32.599 --> 00:00:37.930
at school but most of all- her daddy been
missing fo over a year and ain't nobody know

00:00:37.930 --> 00:00:38.930
where he at.

00:00:38.930 --> 00:00:43.299
So she head downstairs where her lil' bro
Charles Wallace be chillin HARD.

00:00:43.299 --> 00:00:48.239
Brutha like "I was 'spectin you, girl, and
got some milk heatin' up with yo name on it."

00:00:48.240 --> 00:00:49.240
Whaa?

00:00:49.240 --> 00:00:51.360
It's like dis cat can read minds o' somethin!

00:00:51.360 --> 00:00:57.000
Mama come rollin in when all da sudden "WOOF
WOOF" their pup start maddoggin someone at the do'.

00:00:57.000 --> 00:00:58.000
Who is it?

00:00:58.000 --> 00:00:59.839
Oh damn.

00:00:59.839 --> 00:01:04.059
It's some rank hoodrat lookin-lady name Mrs.
Whatsit who tight with Charles Wallace.

00:01:04.060 --> 00:01:09.720
When she tell Meg's mama that the "Tesseract"
is REAL, mama jus' bout shit her pants.

00:01:09.740 --> 00:01:10.740
Hmm..

00:01:10.740 --> 00:01:16.120
Later, Meg and Charles Wallace crew up wit
da campus big dawg Calvin O'Keefe on their

00:01:16.120 --> 00:01:19.330
way to hit up Mrs Whatsit's busted-ass crib.

00:01:19.330 --> 00:01:23.200
Apparently Calvin itchin to hit up da spot,
even though he don't know why.

00:01:23.200 --> 00:01:24.980
So da three of em drop by.

00:01:24.990 --> 00:01:25.990
KNOCK KNOCK.

00:01:25.990 --> 00:01:30.740
The door open all creepy-like and they peep
some lil hag gettin' her sew' on.

00:01:30.740 --> 00:01:33.030
Man Who da hell is THIS?

00:01:33.030 --> 00:01:37.010
Turns out she some OTHER ragedy-ass biddy
named Mrs Who.

00:01:37.010 --> 00:01:42.880
Dis beezy say dem kids best rest up and get
some munchies, cuz they bout to go on an adventure

00:01:42.880 --> 00:01:44.120
to help Meg's daddy!

00:01:44.120 --> 00:01:48.990
Dat night, Calvin get his grub on at da Murry
digs and Meg tell him dat her dad used to

00:01:48.990 --> 00:01:52.560
be a government physicist workin' on top secret
missions.

00:01:52.560 --> 00:01:58.090
Calvin start to get a lil' sweet on Meg and
just when shit bout to get hot Charles, Mrs

00:01:58.090 --> 00:02:04.000
Whatsit, Mrs Who, and da voice of their homegirl
Mrs. Which bust in and say "pack yo shit,

00:02:04.000 --> 00:02:05.260
we gonna go save pops!"

00:02:05.260 --> 00:02:10.530
And ZOOP- they wrinkle through space and land
they asses on the planet Uriel, where there

00:02:10.530 --> 00:02:13.420
be a buncha crazy half-horse half-man aliens.

00:02:13.420 --> 00:02:15.140
And what do ya know?

00:02:15.140 --> 00:02:18.260
All three of em janky biddies are secretly
one of them.

00:02:18.260 --> 00:02:22.030
So they hop up on Mrs. Whatsit and take a
lil' tour of da planet.

00:02:22.030 --> 00:02:26.890
As they cruisin, da kids peep game at a big
evil cloud of darkness dats been trippin up

00:02:26.890 --> 00:02:28.560
da universe since back when.

00:02:28.560 --> 00:02:33.959
Then ZOW- da churrin warp to anotha' planet
in Orion's Belt and visit da "Happy Medium"-

00:02:33.959 --> 00:02:37.200
a girl rockin a fly-ass robe and a crystal
ball.

00:02:37.200 --> 00:02:40.530
She show em a vision of da Earth gettin' WRECKED
by the darkness.

00:02:40.530 --> 00:02:45.470
Word is a bunch of artists, scientists, and
holy rollers like Jesus been tryna buck the

00:02:45.470 --> 00:02:46.740
darkness fo a long ass time.

00:02:46.740 --> 00:02:50.740
Da only way to kill da darkness is fo' a star
to lay a whoop on it.

00:02:50.740 --> 00:02:55.140
Apparently, Mrs. Whatsit used to be a star
back in the day, but she dun blowed herself

00:02:55.150 --> 00:02:59.950
UP tryna' fight the darkness, and dats why
she rollin in tramp-form deez days.

00:02:59.950 --> 00:03:04.050
Jus' befo' they bout to peace out, the 3 dubs
give da kids some gifts since they ain't gonna

00:03:04.050 --> 00:03:06.410
be able to join em at da next stop.

00:03:06.410 --> 00:03:13.069
ZABOING- on to da planet Camazotz where errybody
look and act DA EXACT SAME cuz of some shit

00:03:13.069 --> 00:03:14.069
called IT.

00:03:14.069 --> 00:03:17.280
They all skippin', clappin', and bouncin balls'
in rhythm with eachotha'.

00:03:17.280 --> 00:03:18.280
Creepy.

00:03:18.280 --> 00:03:23.250
So they roll up to the Central Intelligence
building and check some dude with red eyes

00:03:23.250 --> 00:03:25.739
who be hypnotising deez sucka's minds.

00:03:25.739 --> 00:03:28.520
Dude say he know where Meg's daddy at.

00:03:28.520 --> 00:03:33.160
So Charles Wallace sack up and strikes a deal
with this fool: he'll give in to the dude's

00:03:33.160 --> 00:03:38.340
spell and get his ass hypnotized if he show
Meg and Cal where Papa Murry be.

00:03:38.340 --> 00:03:43.820
So Charles get all zombified and lead em to
daddy, who bein held in da slammer cuz he

00:03:43.820 --> 00:03:47.310
was to trill to get brainwashed like errybody
else.

00:03:47.310 --> 00:03:51.920
Usin the fly-ass shades Mrs Who gave her,
Meg busts her daddy out.

00:03:51.920 --> 00:03:57.000
Then they all swang over to da spot where
IT- da big brain dat controllin errybody's mind- be.

00:03:57.120 --> 00:04:01.160
Da closer they get, da mo' control IT got
over their minds.

00:04:01.160 --> 00:04:07.440
So Papa Murry snatch up dem kids and wrinkle
outta dat trap, but Charles Wallace get left behind.

00:04:07.600 --> 00:04:08.599
Damn.

00:04:08.599 --> 00:04:13.610
ZAMBOW- They land on da planet Ixchel, cept
Meg feelin' straight fucked up cuz her dad

00:04:13.610 --> 00:04:16.900
couldn't protect her as they were wrinkling
through the Dark Thing.

00:04:16.900 --> 00:04:22.109
Lucky fo' them though, the nasty lookin' homies
on dis planet are friendly as hell.

00:04:22.109 --> 00:04:26.020
One of dem creatures cures Meg and she start
callin her "Aunt Beast."

00:04:26.020 --> 00:04:30.259
Then dem three half horse hotties drop in
and Meg like "Can y'all hook me up and go

00:04:30.259 --> 00:04:31.990
get Charles Wallace?

00:04:31.990 --> 00:04:33.110
Thanks."

00:04:33.110 --> 00:04:34.110
They like "Psh.

00:04:34.110 --> 00:04:36.550
Da hell you think this is, girl?!"

00:04:36.550 --> 00:04:42.479
Meg recognize it's gotta be HER dat save Charlie
W. Afta' Mrs. Whatsit give Meg da gift of

00:04:42.479 --> 00:04:46.419
love, she get off her lazy ass and wrinkle
over to where Charles at.

00:04:46.419 --> 00:04:51.770
She drop in at IT's crib, and recognize dat
the one thing she got dat IT don't- is love.

00:04:51.770 --> 00:04:57.300
So she focus all her love on CW and free him
from dat hive mind hater.

00:04:57.300 --> 00:05:02.110
Then they warp back to earth and reunite with
da whole fam up in they garden where da three

00:05:02.110 --> 00:05:05.890
Dubs chunk up the deuce and disappear in to da wind.

00:05:10.100 --> 00:05:14.380
One of da things this book preachin dat yo boy Sparky know PLENTY 'bout is dat you can't

00:05:14.389 --> 00:05:15.809
judge a book by its cover.

00:05:15.809 --> 00:05:16.969
Naw mean?

00:05:16.969 --> 00:05:21.599
All throughout dis text things SEEM one way,
but they actually da opposite.

00:05:21.599 --> 00:05:27.579
Fo one, Dem kids doggin on Mrs Whatsit sayin
she look like some nappy street-trick at da beginning.

00:05:27.580 --> 00:05:32.279
But later, they figger out she really a horse
hunny dats one of da most beautiful thangs

00:05:32.279 --> 00:05:33.279
they dun peeped.

00:05:51.860 --> 00:05:52.860
It don't stop there, cous.

00:05:52.860 --> 00:05:58.529
Dat Boy Charlie Dub got all deez haterz sayin
he stoopid cuz he don't talk much, but on

00:05:58.529 --> 00:06:01.819
the real dat dude got MAD brains.

00:06:01.819 --> 00:06:06.869
At first, Camazotz seem like a pretty chill
spot, but when you look closer, there be some

00:06:06.869 --> 00:06:09.649
crazy brainwashing shit goin down.

00:06:09.649 --> 00:06:16.140
Even though dat red-eyed scrub SOUND all nice n' gentle, he ain't got dem red eyes cuz he blazin'.

00:06:16.420 --> 00:06:17.939
He crooked as they come.

00:06:17.939 --> 00:06:21.411
And when they hit the scene at Ixchel, dem
beasties look so whack it's like like they

00:06:21.411 --> 00:06:25.569
bout to boot up and shank a brutha, but it
ain't like dat, yo.

00:06:25.569 --> 00:06:28.849
They heal up Meg like some of da realest hoods
you've eva' seen.

00:06:28.849 --> 00:06:32.649
Keepin' it real ain't always easy when you
stick out from da crowd, though.

00:06:32.649 --> 00:06:37.589
Sometimes it feel better to just blend in
with all da bullshit like Calvin do.

00:06:37.589 --> 00:06:42.659
He only able to roll with the top dawgs at
school cuz he hide his real self, but like

00:06:42.659 --> 00:06:44.879
he say, dat ain't really him.

00:06:59.849 --> 00:07:04.620
Likewise, Meg always trippin cuz she ain't
fit in with all da other kids in school.

00:07:04.620 --> 00:07:07.980
Like she say on page 17, she "hates being
an oddball."

00:07:07.980 --> 00:07:13.400
But when she get a load of all dem identical
drones up on Camazotz, she recognize dat if

00:07:13.409 --> 00:07:16.580
erryone was da same, life would suck a FAT ONE.

00:07:16.580 --> 00:07:20.389
You gotta embrace what make you different from anybody else, ya heard?

00:07:42.870 --> 00:07:47.620
Yuh, all deez kids got they problems, but
instead of "fixing" themselves like some hoods

00:07:47.620 --> 00:07:53.129
in other books be doin, they realize dat as
long as yo homies got you, and you show eachotha

00:07:53.129 --> 00:07:55.919
love, you ain't gotta change nuthin bout yo'self.

00:07:55.919 --> 00:08:00.139
And its cuz of dis dat they able to come together
and beast through the darkness.

00:08:00.139 --> 00:08:04.099
They ain't only got eachother, they also got
a bigger power at their back.

00:08:04.099 --> 00:08:09.159
Whenever shit get too real, da thing that
allow them to keep on da hustle is some legit

00:08:09.159 --> 00:08:10.159
bible talk.

00:08:10.159 --> 00:08:15.740
Not only was Jesus one of the OGs buckin da
dark thing, but characters always slangin

00:08:15.740 --> 00:08:21.339
bible verses at eachotha: Calvin reads Genesis
to Charles Wallace, Mrs Whatsit lays down

00:08:21.339 --> 00:08:24.319
a passage from Corinthians as a gift to Meg...

00:08:24.319 --> 00:08:28.669
Sh*t they even say dem three horse biddies
are like guardian angels.

00:08:28.669 --> 00:08:33.029
Look, you ain't gotta be the hardest hood
on the block to put evil in its place.

00:08:33.029 --> 00:08:37.640
All you need is yo homies by yo side, da lord
in yo heart, and love fo yo'self.

00:08:37.640 --> 00:08:41.060
If you got dat, not even da most twisted evil
can touch you.

00:08:41.060 --> 00:08:44.260
Yo thanks for keepin it 100 with me today. Peace!

